# Documentation Completion Gate

Do not report docs work as complete until this gate passes.

## Mandatory checklist

1. confirm active documentation scope (concept/spec/milestones/dev-log/archive/navigation)
2. verify diff stays within that scope
3. run relevant checks (at minimum link/path/reference validation)
4. ensure active docs reflect the requested structure (`docs/concepts` first, `docs/milestones.md` for delivery order, `docs/dev-log.md` for execution notes, `docs/archive` historical)
5. update `docs/milestones.md` if task status, task order, or execution plan changed
6. append `docs/dev-log.md` if the work completed a meaningful slice
7. list deferred follow-up items explicitly
8. commit the docs changes (no push unless explicitly asked)

## No sync, no completion

- If docs were changed but active navigation/reference paths remain stale, the task is still in progress.
